msgid "Operator Overloading"
msgstr "运算符重载"

msgid "We have studied function overloading, where we can define multiple functions with the same name but different parameter lists. Depending on the arguments used in a function call, the appropriate function is selected."
msgstr "我们已经学过函数重载：可以定义多个名字相同但参数列表不同的函数。根据函数调用时使用的实参，会选择合适的那个函数。"

msgid "Similarly, C++ allows us to overload operators, such as `+`, `=`, `==` and `<<`. This means that we can define how operators such as `+` behave when they are used with objects of user-defined types (i.e., classes). This is known as operator overloading."
msgstr "类似地，C++ 允许我们重载运算符，例如 `+`、`=`、`==` 和 `<<`。这意味着我们可以定义 `+` 等运算符作用于用户自定义类型（即类）的对象时的行为。这被称为运算符重载。"

msgid "**Why Overload Operators?**"
msgstr "**为什么要重载运算符？**"

msgid "Operator overloading can make code more intuitive and easier to read. For example, consider a `Complex` class that represents complex numbers with real and imaginary values. By overloading the `+` operator, we can add two `Complex` objects using the familiar `+` syntax."
msgstr "运算符重载可以让代码更直观、更易读。例如，考虑一个表示复数的 `Complex` 类，它包含实部和虚部。通过重载 `+` 运算符，我们就可以用熟悉的 `+` 语法把两个 `Complex` 对象相加。"

msgid "We will explore how to overload various operators within the context of the `Complex` class defined as follows:"
msgstr "我们将以如下定义的 `Complex` 类为例，探讨如何重载各种运算符："

msgid "**Starting Point: The `Complex` Class**"
msgstr "**起点：`Complex` 类**"

msgid "Overloading the `+` Operator"
msgstr "重载 `+` 运算符"

msgid "We want to add two `Complex` objects using the `+` operator as we show in the following code snippet:"
msgstr "我们希望像下面的代码片段那样，用 `+` 运算符把两个 `Complex` 对象相加："

msgid "Currently, the `+` operator can add two integers or doubles, e.g. `2.0 + i`, where `i` is an integer. Additionally, those who implemented the `string` class in C++ implemented the `+` operator to enable two strings to be \"added\" and produce a new string object with two strings concatenated, e.g. `string s = \"Hello\" + \" world\"`."
msgstr "目前，`+` 运算符可以把两个整数或 double 相加，例如 `2.0 + i`，其中 `i` 是一个整数。此外，实现 C++ 中 `string` 类的人也实现了 `+` 运算符，使两个字符串可以“相加”，得到一个把两个字符串拼接起来的新字符串对象，例如 `string s = \"Hello\" + \" world\"`。"

msgid "Similarly, we need to implement or overload the `+` operator to add two `Complex` objects, i.e. we need to define what `x + y` means when `x` and `y` are `Complex` objects."
msgstr "类似地，我们需要实现（或者说重载）`+` 运算符来把两个 `Complex` 对象相加，也就是说，我们需要定义当 `x` 和 `y` 是 `Complex` 对象时 `x + y` 的含义。"

msgid "**Step 1: Understand the function header**"
msgstr "**第 1 步：理解函数头**"

msgid "In the expression `x + y;`, the left-hand side of the `+` operator is the object of class `Complex`. This means we can interpret the `x + y` to be equivalent to `x.operator+(y)`. The function name is `operator+`. It should be a member function of `Complex` class, since we invoke `operator+` on `x`. The object `y` is passed as an argument to this member function."
msgstr "在表达式 `x + y;` 中，`+` 运算符的左侧是 `Complex` 类的对象。这意味着我们可以把 `x + y` 解释为等价于 `x.operator+(y)`。函数名是 `operator+`。由于我们是在 `x` 上调用 `operator+`，它应当是 `Complex` 类的成员函数。对象 `y` 作为实参传给这个成员函数。"

msgid "operator-plus"
msgstr "operator-plus"

msgid "`x + y` is interpreted as `x.operator+(y)`. The left-hand side of the `+` operator is the object `x`, on which `operator+` of the `Complex` class is invoked. The right-hand side of the `+` operator is the object `y`, which is passed as an argument to the `operator+` member function."
msgstr "`x + y` 被解释为 `x.operator+(y)`。`+` 运算符的左侧是对象 `x`，`Complex` 类的 `operator+` 在它上面被调用。`+` 运算符的右侧是对象 `y`，它作为实参传给成员函数 `operator+`。"

msgid "To implement the `operator+` member function, we need to consider the following:"
msgstr "要实现成员函数 `operator+`，我们需要考虑以下几点："

msgid "**Input Argument Type:** The `operator+` **member** function should take one parameter of type `Complex`, which is the object on the right-hand side of the `+` operator. Since the left-hand side object is the one on which the member function is invoked, it does not need to be passed as a parameter."
msgstr "**输入参数类型：** **成员**函数 `operator+` 应当接收一个 `Complex` 类型的参数，即 `+` 运算符右侧的对象。由于成员函数是在左侧对象上调用的，所以左侧对象不需要作为参数传入。"

msgid "**Return Type:** The `operator+` member function should return a newly created `Complex` object that represents the sum of the two `Complex` objects."
msgstr "**返回类型：** 成员函数 `operator+` 应当返回一个新创建的 `Complex` 对象，表示两个 `Complex` 对象的和。"

msgid "**Public or Private**: The `operator+` member function should be declared as a `public` member function of the `Complex` class to allow it to be accessed from outside the class."
msgstr "**公有还是私有**：成员函数 `operator+` 应当声明为 `Complex` 类的 `public` 成员函数，这样才能在类外访问它。"

msgid "**Step 2: Implement the `operator+` Member Function**"
msgstr "**第 2 步：实现成员函数 `operator+`**"

msgid "We can implement the `operator+` member function as follows:"
msgstr "我们可以这样实现成员函数 `operator+`："

msgid "operator-plus-implement"
msgstr "operator-plus-implement"

msgid "We create a new `Complex` object `temp` to store the sum of the two `Complex` objects. We add the real and imaginary parts separately and return the `temp` object."
msgstr "我们创建一个新的 `Complex` 对象 `temp` 来保存两个 `Complex` 对象的和。我们分别把实部和虚部相加，然后返回 `temp` 对象。"

msgid "We pass the `Complex` object `y` as a parameter to the `operator+` member function and name it `rhs`, short for right-hand side."
msgstr "我们把 `Complex` 对象 `y` 作为参数传给成员函数 `operator+`，并把它命名为 `rhs`，即 right-hand side（右侧）的缩写。"

msgid "We can access the `real` and `img` data members of the left-hand side object `x` (the object on which `operator+` is invoked) directly using `real` and `img` since we are inside a member function of the `Complex` class. We access the `real` and `img` data members of the right-hand side object `rhs` using the dot operator, e.g. `rhs.real` and `rhs.img`."
msgstr "由于我们位于 `Complex` 类的成员函数内部，可以直接用 `real` 和 `img` 访问左侧对象 `x`（即调用 `operator+` 的对象）的数据成员 `real` 和 `img`。对于右侧对象 `rhs` 的数据成员 `real` 和 `img`，我们用点运算符来访问，例如 `rhs.real` 和 `rhs.img`。"

msgid "Inside the function, we create a new `Complex` object `temp` to store the sum of the two `Complex` objects. We set the real of `temp` to the sum of the `real` of `y` (`rhs.real`) and the real of the left-hand side object `x`, which is just `real` since `operator+` is invoked on `x`. We do the same for the imaginary part."
msgstr "在函数内部，我们创建一个新的 `Complex` 对象 `temp` 来保存两个 `Complex` 对象的和。我们把 `temp` 的实部设为 `y` 的 `real`（`rhs.real`）与左侧对象 `x` 的实部之和；由于 `operator+` 是在 `x` 上调用的，`x` 的实部直接写作 `real` 即可。虚部也同样处理。"

msgid "Finally, we return the `temp` object. The return type of `operator+` is `Complex`, which matches the type of the object we are returning."
msgstr "最后，我们返回 `temp` 对象。`operator+` 的返回类型是 `Complex`，与我们返回的对象类型一致。"

msgid "Return by value"
msgstr "按值返回"

msgid "`operator+` returns a `Complex` object by value. This means that a copy of the `temp` object is returned to the caller. Returning by value is important because the scope of `temp` will end by the end of the function and it will be destroyed. We want to return a newly created `Complex` object that is a copy of `temp` object at the time of return to by used in the caller function, e.g. `main` function."
msgstr "`operator+` 按值返回一个 `Complex` 对象。这意味着返回给调用者的是 `temp` 对象的一个副本。按值返回很重要，因为 `temp` 的作用域会在函数结束时结束，它会被销毁。我们希望返回一个新创建的 `Complex` 对象，它是返回时刻 `temp` 对象的副本，供调用函数（例如 `main` 函数）使用。"

msgid "**Step 3: Optimizations on the `operator+` Member Function**"
msgstr "**第 3 步：优化成员函数 `operator+`**"

msgid "We can make three main optimizations to the `operator+` member function:"
msgstr "我们可以对成员函数 `operator+` 做三项主要优化："

msgid "**Pass the parameter by reference:** Passing the `Complex` object `rhs` by value creates a copy of `rhs` just for the `operator+` function. This can be memory inefficient especially if `Complex` has many data members. Instead, we can pass it by reference to avoid making a copy of the object when the function is called. This means we change the parameter type from `Complex rhs` to `Complex& rhs`."
msgstr "**按引用传递参数：** 按值传递 `Complex` 对象 `rhs` 会专门为 `operator+` 函数创建一个 `rhs` 的副本。这可能会浪费内存，尤其是当 `Complex` 有很多数据成员时。我们可以改为按引用传递，避免在调用函数时复制对象。也就是把参数类型从 `Complex rhs` 改为 `Complex& rhs`。"

msgid "**Pass `rhs` as a `const`**: We can ensure that the function does not modify the `rhs` object. This is important because `rhs` is the right-hand side object of the `+` operator, and we do not want to change its value when performing addition. To do this, we can declare the parameter as a `const` reference, i.e. `const Complex& rhs`."
msgstr "**把 `rhs` 作为 `const` 传递**：我们可以确保函数不会修改 `rhs` 对象。这很重要，因为 `rhs` 是 `+` 运算符右侧的对象，我们不希望在做加法时改变它的值。为此，我们可以把参数声明为 `const` 引用，即 `const Complex& rhs`。"

msgid "**Make the function `const`:** We can declare the `operator+` member function as a `const` member function to indicate that it does not modify the state of the left-hand side object. This is done by adding the `const` keyword after the function parameter list, i.e. `Complex operator+(const Complex& rhs) const`."
msgstr "**把函数声明为 `const`：** 我们可以把成员函数 `operator+` 声明为 `const` 成员函数，表示它不会修改左侧对象的状态。做法是在函数参数列表后加上 `const` 关键字，即 `Complex operator+(const Complex& rhs) const`。"

msgid "optimize-operator-plus"
msgstr "optimize-operator-plus"

msgid "Overloading the `==` Operator"
msgstr "重载 `==` 运算符"

msgid "Before getting to the `operator=` or assignment operator, another common operator to overload is the equality operator `==`. We can use this operator to compare two `Complex` objects for equality. For example, we want to be able to write the following code:"
msgstr "在讲 `operator=`（即赋值运算符）之前，另一个常被重载的运算符是相等运算符 `==`。我们可以用它来比较两个 `Complex` 对象是否相等。例如，我们希望能够写出下面的代码："

msgid "We can overload the `==` operator to compare two `Complex` objects for equality. The `==` operator should return `true` if both the real and imaginary parts of the two `Complex` objects are equal, and `false` otherwise."
msgstr "我们可以重载 `==` 运算符来比较两个 `Complex` 对象是否相等。如果两个 `Complex` 对象的实部和虚部都相等，`==` 运算符应返回 `true`，否则返回 `false`。"

msgid "In line 24, we write the function header for the `operator==` member function. The left-hand side object is the one on which the member function is invoked, and the right-hand side object is passed as a `const` reference parameter. The return type of the function is `bool`, which indicates whether the two `Complex` objects are equal or not."
msgstr "在第 24 行，我们写出成员函数 `operator==` 的函数头。成员函数在左侧对象上调用，右侧对象则作为 `const` 引用参数传入。函数的返回类型是 `bool`，表示两个 `Complex` 对象是否相等。"

msgid "The function is declared as a `const` member function since it does not modify the state of the left-hand side object. It also receives the right-hand side object as a `const` reference to avoid making a copy and to ensure that it is not modified."
msgstr "由于该函数不会修改左侧对象的状态，它被声明为 `const` 成员函数。它还以 `const` 引用的形式接收右侧对象，以避免复制并确保右侧对象不被修改。"

msgid "In line 25, we compare the `real` and `img` data members of the left-hand side object and the right-hand side object `rhs.real` and `rhs.img` using the `==` operator for `double` values. If both parts are equal, we return `true`; otherwise, we return `false`."
msgstr "在第 25 行，我们用 `double` 值的 `==` 运算符，把左侧对象的数据成员 `real` 和 `img` 与右侧对象的 `rhs.real` 和 `rhs.img` 进行比较。如果两部分都相等，就返回 `true`；否则返回 `false`。"

msgid "We use the overloaded `==` operator in line 32 to compare the two `Complex` objects `x` and `y`. Since both objects have the same real and imaginary parts, the output will be `x is equal to y`."
msgstr "在第 32 行，我们使用重载后的 `==` 运算符比较两个 `Complex` 对象 `x` 和 `y`。由于两个对象的实部和虚部都相同，输出将是 `x is equal to y`。"

msgid "Overloading the `=` Operator"
msgstr "重载 `=` 运算符"

msgid "In the previous example, we used two operators: `+` and `=` in `z = x + y;`, where `z`, `x` and `y` are `Complex` objects. We successfully overloaded the `+` operator to add two `Complex` objects. This returns a a new `Complex` object (let's call it `temp`). Then, the assignment operator `=` is used to assign the value of `temp` to the object `z`."
msgstr "在前面的例子中，我们在 `z = x + y;` 里用到了两个运算符：`+` 和 `=`，其中 `z`、`x` 和 `y` 都是 `Complex` 对象。我们已经成功重载了 `+` 运算符来把两个 `Complex` 对象相加，它会返回一个新的 `Complex` 对象（我们称之为 `temp`）。然后，赋值运算符 `=` 被用来把 `temp` 的值赋给对象 `z`。"

msgid "It's time to overload the assignment operator `=`: `operator=`. **The good news is C++ provides a default assignment operator `operator=` for classes**. It performs a member-wise assignment of data members from the right-hand side object to the left-hand side object. This means the data members of `temp` are copied to the corresponding data members of `z`."
msgstr "现在该重载赋值运算符 `=` 了，即 `operator=`。**好消息是，C++ 会为类提供一个默认的赋值运算符 `operator=`**。它把右侧对象的数据成员逐个赋值给左侧对象。也就是说，`temp` 的数据成员会被复制到 `z` 对应的数据成员中。"

msgid "Let's implement the default assignment operator for the `Complex` class to understand how it works."
msgstr "让我们为 `Complex` 类实现这个默认的赋值运算符，以理解它是如何工作的。"

msgid "In the expression `z = temp;`,"
msgstr "在表达式 `z = temp;` 中，"

msgid "We can interpret the `z = temp` to be equivalent to `z.operator=(temp)`."
msgstr "我们可以把 `z = temp` 解释为等价于 `z.operator=(temp)`。"

msgid "The function name is `operator=`."
msgstr "函数名是 `operator=`。"

msgid "It should be a member function of `Complex` class, since we invoke `operator=` on `z`."
msgstr "由于我们是在 `z` 上调用 `operator=`，它应当是 `Complex` 类的成员函数。"

msgid "The object `temp` is passed as an argument to this member function of type `Complex`."
msgstr "对象 `temp` 作为 `Complex` 类型的实参传给这个成员函数。"

msgid "The function name and parameter type are written as follows:"
msgstr "函数名和参数类型写法如下："

msgid "In C/C++, the assignment operator `=` must return something that allows for chained assignments, e.g. `z = y = x;`. This statement is evaluated right to left, i.e. `y = x` `x` is assigned to `y`, then in `z = y` `y` is assigned to `z`. In C/C++ standard, we should return from `operator=` the **original** left-hand side object after the assignment. Therefore, the assignment operator `=` must return a reference to the left-hand side object to allow for this chaining, which is of `Complex` class type. We add the `&` symbol to indicate that we are returning a reference."
msgstr "在 C/C++ 中，赋值运算符 `=` 必须返回某个值，以支持链式赋值，例如 `z = y = x;`。这条语句从右向左求值，即先在 `y = x` 中把 `x` 赋给 `y`，再在 `z = y` 中把 `y` 赋给 `z`。按照 C/C++ 标准，`operator=` 应当返回赋值之后的**原**左侧对象。因此，赋值运算符 `=` 必须返回对左侧对象的引用（其类型为 `Complex` 类）才能支持这种链式赋值。我们加上 `&` 符号，表示返回的是一个引用。"

msgid "chained-operator="
msgstr "chained-operator="

msgid "In chained assignments like `z = y = x;`, the expression `y = x` is evaluated first, and the result, which is the original `y`, is then assigned to `z`. To enable this chaining, the assignment operator `=` must return a reference to the left-hand side object, or the object on which we invoked the `operator=` member function."
msgstr "在像 `z = y = x;` 这样的链式赋值中，表达式 `y = x` 先被求值，其结果（即原来的 `y`）再被赋给 `z`。为了支持这种链式赋值，赋值运算符 `=` 必须返回对左侧对象的引用，也就是调用成员函数 `operator=` 的那个对象。"

msgid "Putting it all together, the function header for the assignment operator `=` is as follows:"
msgstr "把所有部分组合起来，赋值运算符 `=` 的函数头如下："

msgid "**Step 2: Implement the `operator=` Member Function**"
msgstr "**第 2 步：实现成员函数 `operator=`**"

msgid "We can implement the `operator=` member function by setting the data members of the left-hand side object to the corresponding data members of the right-hand side object `rhs`, i.e. `real = rhs.real` and `img = rhs.img`."
msgstr "实现成员函数 `operator=` 的方法是：把左侧对象的数据成员设为右侧对象 `rhs` 对应的数据成员，即 `real = rhs.real` 和 `img = rhs.img`。"

msgid "**How can we get the reference to the left-hand side object?** One way is to use the `this` pointer. The `this` pointer points to the object on which the member function is invoked. Therefore, in `z.operator=(temp)`, `this` points to the object `z`. We can dereference the `this` pointer using `*this` to get the left-hand side object itself. `this` is of type `Complex*`, so `*this` is of type `Complex`. To return a reference to the left-hand side object, we use `return *this;`."
msgstr "**怎样得到对左侧对象的引用？** 一种方法是使用 `this` 指针。`this` 指针指向调用该成员函数的对象。因此，在 `z.operator=(temp)` 中，`this` 指向对象 `z`。我们可以用 `*this` 对 `this` 指针解引用，得到左侧对象本身。`this` 的类型是 `Complex*`，所以 `*this` 的类型是 `Complex`。要返回对左侧对象的引用，我们使用 `return *this;`。"

msgid "We can visualize each object and the `this` pointer as follows:"
msgstr "我们可以把每个对象和 `this` 指针可视化如下："

msgid "this-pointer"
msgstr "this-pointer"

msgid "The `this` pointer points to the object on which we invoke the function on, e.g. object `z`. We can dereference the `this` pointer using `*this` to get the left-hand side object itself."
msgstr "`this` 指针指向我们调用该函数的对象，例如对象 `z`。我们可以用 `*this` 对 `this` 指针解引用，得到左侧对象本身。"

msgid "Below is the complete implementation of the `operator=` member function:"
msgstr "下面是成员函数 `operator=` 的完整实现："

msgid "operator-equals-implement"
msgstr "operator-equals-implement"

msgid "We copy the `real` and `img` data members from the right-hand side object `rhs` to the left-hand side object using the dot operator. Finally, we return a reference to the left-hand side object using `*this`."
msgstr "我们用点运算符把右侧对象 `rhs` 的数据成员 `real` 和 `img` 复制到左侧对象中。最后，我们用 `*this` 返回对左侧对象的引用。"

msgid "In the image above, we optimize the `operator=` member function by passing the right-hand side object `rhs` as a `const` reference to avoid making a copy and to ensure that it is not modified."
msgstr "在上图中，我们对成员函数 `operator=` 做了优化：以 `const` 引用的形式传递右侧对象 `rhs`，以避免复制并确保它不被修改。"

msgid "We didn't make the `operator=` member function a `const` member function because it modifies the state of the left-hand side object."
msgstr "我们没有把成员函数 `operator=` 声明为 `const` 成员函数，因为它会修改左侧对象的状态。"

